{"schemaVersion":1,"id":310,"sections":[{"id":"607008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20515],"start":0,"count":41},{"id":"607008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20516],"start":41,"count":20}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:0","scriptId":20515,"text":"扎莉正在观测整片区域的信号旗散布情况——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:1","scriptId":20515,"text":"“还以为我们是第一个到的呢，结果已经有队伍先发现这片区域了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":541,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:2","scriptId":20515,"text":"“哦？是哪个队伍啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":541,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:3","scriptId":20515,"text":"“我们的熟人，郁金香小队。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":541,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:4","scriptId":20515,"text":"扎莉无奈地笑笑，把望眼镜收了回去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":541,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:5","scriptId":20515,"text":"“那怎么办？虽然她们也是死水的队伍，但这次的作战是允许相互攻击的，抢夺旗帜是合规行为。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:6","scriptId":20515,"text":"“米歇尔你的意思是让我们从那两个小朋友手里抢旗子？这我可做不出来啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":541,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:7","scriptId":20515,"text":"“我同意扎莉的说法，但是这片区域也挺大的不是吗？大家互不干涉就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":541,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:8","scriptId":20515,"text":"“恩，正有这个打算。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":541,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:9","scriptId":20515,"text":"“但不排除郁金香会攻击我们的可能，小心点总没错的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:10","scriptId":20515,"text":"“你说得对，那就先行动起来吧，适当的警戒还是需要的，虽然我想郁金香应该不会主动过来自讨没趣。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":692,"speaker":"米歇尔·法梅加","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:11","scriptId":20515,"text":"“郁金香走的是9点方向，所以我推荐从3点方向开始。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:12","scriptId":20515,"text":"“OK，出发。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":632,"right":692,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:14","scriptId":20515,"text":"扎莉她们进入区域之后，立刻就被郁金香小队的成员侦察到了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:15","scriptId":20515,"text":"和预想的一样郁金香小队并没有要进攻的意思，两队相安无事地进行着收集工作。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:16","scriptId":20515,"text":"直到第三支队伍出现——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:17","scriptId":20515,"text":"“在那里的是郁金香小队嘛，她们队伍应该不会主动来攻击我们吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:18","scriptId":20515,"text":"“那当然，伊迪丝是不会主动挑起争端的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:19","scriptId":20515,"text":"“既然9点钟方向是郁金香小队，那我们就在她们反方向收集吧，这样也不冲突。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:20","scriptId":20515,"text":"“好嘞～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:21","scriptId":20515,"text":"一说完佐伊就马力全开扬尘而去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:22","scriptId":20515,"text":"“佐伊这家伙……又不是很急，慢慢收集也可以的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:23","scriptId":20515,"text":"“佩妮你也跟着去看下吧，虽然是死水周边区域，但还是小心为上。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:24","scriptId":20515,"text":"“了解。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:26","scriptId":20515,"text":"有佩妮跟随的话就很让人放心了，沉着冷静的性格遇事不像她姐姐那样慌乱，实在是难得的人才。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:27","scriptId":20515,"text":"","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:30","scriptId":20515,"text":"“怎么回事！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:31","scriptId":20515,"text":"佐伊和佩妮所在的方向传来了一阵轰鸣声。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":578,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:32","scriptId":20515,"text":"“诶呀？……难道还有其他的队伍在这里埋伏？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:33","scriptId":20515,"text":"“情况不明。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":596,"right":578,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:35","scriptId":20515,"text":"我们火速赶往佐伊她们所在的位置……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:36","scriptId":20515,"text":"在那里等待着我们的是——三位穿着帅气制服的钢舞姬。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":541,"speaker":"伊达·布鲁克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:37","scriptId":20515,"text":"“哟吼～我还想怎么就只有两个人，原来在后面啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":541,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:38","scriptId":20515,"text":"伊达站在扎莉和米歇尔的前面，一副高高在上的模样就好像她是队长似得……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":541,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:39","scriptId":20515,"text":"“黑色闪电……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:40","scriptId":20515,"text":"黑色闪电的队长——扎莉·魏特曼","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:41","scriptId":20515,"text":"“果然是你们啊，捕获过旅行者的小队。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:42","scriptId":20515,"text":"“那个……并没有规定小队相遇就必须要战斗的吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":632,"speaker":"扎莉·魏特曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:43","scriptId":20515,"text":"“确实，虽然我们无冤无仇，但我个人是很想和你们小队战上一回，现在正好是个机会。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:44","scriptId":20515,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-PROLOGUE:20515:45","scriptId":20515,"text":"和黑色闪电的战斗在所难免。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:0","scriptId":20516,"text":"由于中途郁金香小队的介入，让我们有了可趁之机。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:1","scriptId":20516,"text":"从黑色闪电的眼皮底下溜之大吉。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:2","scriptId":20516,"text":"“果然是死水精锐，我们正面可不是他们的对手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:3","scriptId":20516,"text":"我看了一眼佐伊，开场五分钟就被打得全身都是漆弹……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:4","scriptId":20516,"text":"“先回基地清洗下，正好把旗语也给换了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":632,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:5","scriptId":20516,"text":"“呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:6","scriptId":20516,"text":"“米歇尔的攻击很精准，但我有信心下次能完全躲开她的弹道……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:7","scriptId":20516,"text":"负责牵制攻击的佩妮身上也有一些漆弹的痕迹。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":584,"right":740,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:8","scriptId":20516,"text":"“没关系的啦～虽然有点惨，但是黑色闪电并没从我们这里拿到好处。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:9","scriptId":20516,"text":"“是啊，信号旗一面没少，这多亏郁金香小队的乱入……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:10","scriptId":20516,"text":"“确实没想到伊迪丝她们会从侧面偷袭，扎莉当时也吓了一跳呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:11","scriptId":20516,"text":"“真是人算不如天算，刻意回避的目标竟然成了我们的救命稻草。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:12","scriptId":20516,"text":"“和扎莉她们战斗真是一点好处都没有啊……赢不了也就拿不到旗帜。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:13","scriptId":20516,"text":"需要重新制定收集旗帜的方针，这时——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:14","scriptId":20516,"text":"“不，有收获。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:15","scriptId":20516,"text":"维卡把一张脏兮兮的纸条交给我，上面写着“PIXY”的字样，这不由得让我眼前一亮。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:16","scriptId":20516,"text":"“啊呀！？这不是特定的旗语吗？维卡你怎么找到的？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:17","scriptId":20516,"text":"“在一颗大树上，被炮弹的烟尘给刮下来的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:18","scriptId":20516,"text":"相对于信号旗，正确的旗语更为重要，没想到还能歪打正着拿到新的旗语，那这次的遭遇战就值回票价了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"607008-EPILOGUE:20516:19","scriptId":20516,"text":"“干得漂亮，回去先把这套旗语兑换了看看，不知道会是什么样的奖品呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-12.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
